Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0
Recommends: jwm
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: Desktop Settings for Pivuan Audio (JWM)
 A small window for the Pivuan Audio desktop: the desktop background (the
 Pivuan backgrounds or any picture), program icons on the panel, the panel's
 size, color and icon size, hiding the panel, the on-screen keyboard
 button, the screen's brightness and long press for right click on a
 touchscreen. It also has the brightness and volume sliders of the panel's
 buttons. It saves ~/.config/pivuan/desktop.conf and restarts JWM, which reads
 it through /usr/lib/pivuan/jwm-desktop (set up by Pivuan Audio in
 pivuan-config).
